      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely understandable to feel that sense of existential weight when contemplating the vastness of the universe and the apparent meaninglessness of daily struggles. Many philosophical traditions wrestle with this very tension between finding purpose in a seemingly indifferent cosmos. Perhaps the meaning isn't something that's *given*, but something we actively create through our connections, creativity, and chosen values.",
      "source": "target",
